## 2 · Analyze and route

Creates a bounded snapshot of public-facing fields, compares it with the last verified release, and checks revisions, public URL, placeholders, and unsafe URL protocols.

Routing distinguishes:
- a deliberately private API/ChatGPT draft;
- a new revision already published by the dashboard;
- a duplicate revision that needs no work.
